  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Whenever I enter any room, around 40-50% of all avatars are either very broken, or missing 98% of its textures. Their shadows still show, but no model itself. It has a clear texture, so if you were to look at it from an angle, you can sometimes seen the outline of the character, but still completely invisible. I'm not sure if its a shader issue outside of the game, but like said, this is 50% of all characters in the game, if I rejoin a room, they are still invisible. As for the blue and white playermodel, thats supposed to be Cuphead I'm sure, but multiple people said their model was cuphead.",
